OL,3,GNEWSAMore names unveiled on veterans'
OL,4,Apathway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further 32 tribute stones have been
OL,7,Funveiled on a pathway marking the
OL,8,Fcontribution of servicemen and women.
OL,10,FThe Veterans' Walk project in Mowbray
OL,11,FPark, Sunderland, was started 10 years
OL,12,Fago by Tom Cuthbertson whose
OL,13,Fparatrooper son Nathan, 19, was killed
OL,14,Fin Afghanistan in 2008.
OL,16,FThe 11.3kg (25lb) granite flagstones
OL,17,Feach have the name of a former or
OL,18,Fserving member of HM Armed Forces, with
OL,19,Fnew stones naming people with
OL,20,Fconnections to the city.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
