OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore names unveiled on veterans'
OL,4,Apathway
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of a dedication service on
OL,7,FSaturday morning, Cuthbertson said the
OL,8,Fwalk was a tribute rather than a
OL,9,Fmemorial, saying: "It recognises
OL,10,Fveterans who are still with us as well
OL,11,Fas those who have sadly passed away."
